{"products": [{"id": 5234049253509, "title": "TILE CEILING PANEL LIGHT SQUARE 2X2 BACK LIGHT", "handle": "ol-48-watt-tile-ceiling-panel-light-square", "body_html": "<style><!--\np, li{\nfont-size: 13px;\n}\nspan{\nfont-size: 20px;\nfont-weight: 500px;\n}>\n--></style>\n<p><span><b> Description </b></span><br><br></p>\n<h3>Buy Online Tile Panel Ceiling Panel Light Square Back Light.</h3>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">To add a layer of aesthetic lighting to your ceilings and brighten up your interiors, <strong>Buy Online Tile Panel Ceiling Panel Light Square</strong> . We at Orient Lighting have designed these lighting fixtures using high-quality Aluminum to provide a heat sink that converts all the energy consumed into illumination. <br><br>Also, the <a href=\"https://www.orientlighting.com.pk/collections/led-recessed-surface-panels\"><strong>Ceiling Panel Light Square for Home</strong></a> is easy to install, lights up as soon as switched on, saves up to 80% of energy, and lasts for up to 8 years \u2013 without lowering the brightness level. Our customers also <strong>buy Ceiling Panel Light Square for Commercial Area</strong> because it provides broad and bright light throughout interiors.</p>\n<ul></ul>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/des_icon_img.png\"></p>\n<h2>Applications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Home</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Office</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Malls</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Hospitality</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Commercial Area</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Shops</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Other General Use</li>\n</ul>", "published_at": "2024-08-25T14:36:26+05:00", "created_at": "2021-01-07T10:47:00+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T22:39:57+05:00", "vendor": "Orient", "product_type": "Panels", "tags": ["24 x 24 inch", "3000K", "4200K", "48 Watt", "6500K", "