me": "Color temperature", "position": 1, "values": ["DAY LIGHT 6500K", "NATURAL LIGHT 4000K", "WARM LIGHT 3000K"]}, {"name": "WATTS", "position": 2, "values": ["36 WATT", "48 WATT"]}]}, {"id": 7236070342789, "title": "Moon light Series Surface Panel", "handle": "moon-light-series-surface-panel", "body_html": "<p data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"150\"><strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"150\">Moon Light Surface Panel Light</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"538\">The Moon Light Surface Panel Light is a sleek and energy-efficient lighting solution designed for modern residential and commercial spaces. Featuring a slim, circular profile with uniform light distribution, it delivers bright illumination while maintaining a clean and elegant appearance. Its surface-mounted design makes it ideal for areas where recessed installation is not possible.</p>\n<p data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"858\">Manufactured with high-quality LED components and a durable housing, the Moon Light Surface Panel ensures long service life, low power consumption, and minimal maintenance. The soft, glare-free light enhances visual comfort, making it suitable for living rooms, offices, corridors, shops, and hospitality environments.</p>\n<p data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"883\"><strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"883\">Available Variants:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"940\">\n<li data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"902\">\n<p data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"902\"><strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"902\">18W \u2013 4 Inch</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"921\">\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"921\"><strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"921\">24W \u2013 6 Inch</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"940\">\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"940\"><strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"940\">36W \u2013 8 Inch</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"959\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"959\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1167\">\n<li data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1002\">\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1002\">Slim and modern surface-mounted design</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1038\">\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1038\">Energy-efficient LED technology</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1084\">Uniform brightness with wide light spread</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1125\">\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1125\">Long lifespan and stable performance</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1167\">\n<p data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1167\">Easy installation and low maintenance</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1321\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The Moon Light Surface Panel Light combines performance, efficiency, and aesthetics, making it a reliable choice for contemporary lighting requirements.</p>", "published_at": "2026-01-26T16:14:41+05:00", "created_at": "2026-01-26T15:54:08+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T22:39:57+05:00", "vendor": "ORIENT Lighting", "product_type": "Panels", "tags": ["Borderless", "CEILING PANEL LIGHT", "lighting", "Panels", "SMD"], "variants": [{"id": 41500955771013, "title": "18Watt 4Inch / Warm Light", "option1": "18Watt 4Inch", "option2": "Warm Light", "option3": null, "sku": "500000000161", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 34687791890565, "product_id": 7236070342789, "position": 2, "created_at": "2026-01-26T15:59:26+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-01-26T16:05:30+05:00", "alt": null, "width": 4016, "height": 4016, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/Surfacepanellight-1.png?v=1769425530", "variant_ids": [41500955771013, 41500955803781, 41500955836549, 41500955902085, 41500955934853, 41500955967621, 41500956033157, 41500956065925, 41500956098693]}, "available": true, "price": "940.00", "grams": 300, "compare_at_price": null, "p